This directory and everything under it (characters/**, including every pack
under _archive/) is the character artwork of Ponko HUD: the source
illustrations in src/, the block-character frames and their metadata in
frames/ (the .ans, .json, pack.json and preview.html files derived from
them), and any future packs.

These files are NOT covered by the MIT license that applies to the source
code of Ponko HUD (see ../LICENSE). No permission is granted to copy them
out, modify them, redistribute them, sublicense them, sell them, or use them
in derivative works — commercial or otherwise.

What you may do:

  - run Ponko HUD with these assets as shipped;
  - keep them inside a fork or clone of this repository, as long as they are
    not separated from the project and redistributed on their own;
  - show screenshots or recordings of the running application.

For anything else, open an issue on the repository and ask first.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

本目录及其下所有内容（characters/ 全部子目录，含 _archive/ 里的每个包）是
Ponko HUD 的角色形象素材：src/ 里的原图、frames/ 里由它们生成的方块字符帧
与元数据（.ans、.json、pack.json、preview.html），以及以后新增的包。

这些文件**不适用** Ponko HUD 源码的 MIT 许可（见 ../LICENSE）。未授予任何
复制、修改、再分发、再许可、销售或用于衍生作品的许可，商业用途与否皆同。

你可以：

  - 按原样运行 Ponko HUD 并使用这些素材；
  - 在 fork 或克隆的本仓库里保留它们，前提是它们没有被单独摘出来再分发；
  - 展示运行中应用的截图或录像。

其他用途请先在仓库开 issue 询问。
